<main id="content" class="site-main page mt-classic"><div class="page-header"><h1 class="entry-title">Refresh Your Water Features With Midwest Tropical Makeovers</h1></div><div class="page-content"><p>Like all other things, water features too require renovation after some time. Whether you are looking to give your interior a change or want to repair your water structure, Midwest Tropical has the best resources, designs, and professionals to help you with your endeavor.</p><p>From water bubble wall renovation to rain curtains and fountains, everything is fixable with us! Since water features are the focal point of your spaces that strike an impression, it is important that you get them fixed or redone to restore the magnificence of your homes and offices.</p><h2>Customer Water Features Renovation</h2><p>Get your water feature renovated according to your taste and the requirement of the space. Although Midwest Tropical has an expansive collection of designs and styles, the customization option is a liberty we offer you on top of exquisite designs and high-end water features.</p><p>The pool area of your house or building can be made more luxurious and classy with our custom water features pool renovation service. Expand, redesign, or get your pool repaired using our premium renovation services that have your interest and happiness in mind. Discuss with our renovation specialists the changes you wish and how you envision your pool area so that you get an overhaul you fall in love with.</p><h2>Restore Your Rooms To Their Ultimate Beauty</h2><p>If you have an indoor waterfall for renovation, do not shy away from ringing Midwest Tropical to help you with the task. We can embellish it with more stunning additions that will transform the look of your indoor spaces. There are different waterfall styles that we can work to incorporate into your surroundings, giving it your unique touch so that anyone who walks in admires the magnificent structure.</p><p>The indoor wall waterfall for renovation can also be upgraded according to the requirement of your spaces. Schedule a meeting so that our experts can visit the site, know your plans, and advise you accordingly before coming up with the new water feature for you.</p><p><a href="/gallery/"><br /><picture><source srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-50x50.webp 50w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-100x100.jpg.webp 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-150x84.jpg.webp 150w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-300x168.jpg.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-380x213.jpg.webp 380w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-480x269.jpg.webp 480w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1.jpg 570w" type="image/webp"><img decoding="async" width="570" height="320" src="/wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1.jpg" alt="Gallery Banner 1" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-50x50.webp 50w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-100x100.jpg 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-150x84.jpg 150w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-300x168.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-380x213.jpg 380w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-480x269.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1.jpg 570w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" title="It Is Time To Give Your Water Features A Makeover 1" data-mtfi="1"></picture></a><br /><img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" width="1280" height="720" src="/wp-content/uploads/hf9hfgkkpqmaxresdefault-1-0x0.jpg" alt="hf9hfgkkpqmaxresdefault 1" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/hf9hfgkkpqmaxresdefault-1-jpg-300x169.avif 300w, /wp-content/uploads/hf9hfgkkpqmaxresdefault-1-jpg-600x338.avif 600w, /wp-content/uploads/hf9hfgkkpqmaxresdefault-1-768x432.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/hf9hfgkkpqmaxresdefault-1-jpg.avif 1280w" sizes="(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px" title="It Is Time To Give Your Water Features A Makeover 2"></p><h2>We Know How To Beautify Spaces</h2><p>Elevate the aesthetics of your homes and offices with Midwest Tropical. Water features have always been in trend and a time tested way to make indoor areas beautiful. Midwest Tropical gives this trend a shake with its modern designs and styles. The use of various new materials that enhance the water feature and the place it is installed in that further notches up the appeal of your buildings.</p><p>Reach out to Midwest Tropical for amazing water features and renovations now!</p><section class="mtx-related" aria-labelledby="mtx-related-title"><div class="mtx-related__inner"><div class="mtx-related__head"><h2 id="mtx-related-title">Explore more custom water features</h2><p>Popular feature types and recent articles.</p></div><ul class="mtx-related__grid"><li><a href="/bubble-walls/"><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Water feature type</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Bubble Walls</span></a></li><li><a href="/rain-curtains/"><span class="mtx-related__img"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/Vertical-Chamber-Bubble-Wall-Homewood-SUites-Orlando-FLorida-300x1631-jpg.avif" alt="" width="480" height="320"></span><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Water feature type</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Rain Curtains</span></a></li><li><a href="/specialty-fountains/"><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Water feature type</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Custom Fountains</span></a></li><li><a href="/swirly-or-vertical-chamber-choosing-a-bubble-wall-style-for-your-space/"><span class="mtx-related__img"><picture><source srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Swirly-or-Vertical-Chamber-Choosing-a-Bubble-Wall-Style-for-Your-Space-768x512.png.webp" type="image/webp"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/Swirly-or-Vertical-Chamber-Choosing-a-Bubble-Wall-Style-for-Your-Space-768x512.png" alt="" width="480" height="320"></picture></span><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Article</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Swirly or Vertical Chamber? Choosing a Bubble Wall Style for Your Space</span></a></li><li><a href="/swirly-bubble-walls-and-the-art-of-movement-in-interior-design/"><span class="mtx-related__img"><picture><source srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Swirly-Bubble-Walls-and-the-Art-of-Movement-in-Interior-Design-1-1-768x512.png.webp" type="image/webp"><img decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/wp-content/uploads/Swirly-Bubble-Walls-and-the-Art-of-Movement-in-Interior-Design-1-1-768x512.png" alt="" width="480" height="320"></picture></span><span class="mtx-related__kicker">Article</span><span class="mtx-related__title">Swirly Bubble Walls and the Art of Movement in Interior Design</span></a></li></ul><div class="mtx-related__cta"><p><strong>Planning a water feature?</strong> Free design consultation and price estimate — since 1977, made in Skokie, Illinois, installed nationwide.</p><a class="mtx-btn" href="/request-a-quote/">Request a free consultation</a><a class="mtx-btn mtx-btn--ghost" href="tel:+18883652393">Call 888-365-2393</a></div></div></section></div></main>
